## Executive Summary
The openOODA 12-agent swarm has completed comprehensive implementation, adversarial verification, integration testing, and documentation alignment for the Road to Beta (RTB-1 through RTB-5) deliverables and the v0.198.0-alpha release baseline.

All 12 distinct agent perspectives have verified the codebase without conflicting edits, race conditions, or unhandled residuals.

